            "review_title": "Review at Om Vegan Garden",
            "review_text": "Jay323443\nToronto, Canada26 contributions\n0\nMost delicious!!\nAug 2018 • Friends\nFor an option-starved tourist like me, finding an alternative to water spinach, mushrooms and tofu (often cooked in the same manner), Om Vegan Garden was a vegetarian's delight. Not only was the ambience tasteful, I loved the presentation of the food items. There was an abundant variety of dishes and most delicious. The service was also wonderful. In the end, I was stuffed but didn't feel heavy.\n\nMy only disappointment was that I could not enjoy the gardens because of a heavy downpour we experienced just as we got there. Perhaps next time!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 17, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
