            "review_title": "Review at Om Vegan Garden",
            "review_text": "lisybutterfly\nErpeldange, Luxembourg21 contributions\n0\nAmazing Food\nApr 2018 • Solo\nI don’t know why this place hasn’t got more reviews, because it truly is magical! Lots of vegan options, the food is absolutely delicious and has actually some local dishes, which makes it stand out from all the other western vegan locations I’ve seen in Asia. It’s always lovely to try some traditional options. The restaurant is in a quiet side street and has a beautiful garden with butterflies and lush greenery. It may be pricier than other places but $9 for a starter, a main and a bomb avocado smoothie I was full and satisfied. A must try!\nRead more\nWritten April 29, 2018",
